  "description": "If Emily had not joined the hunters, her destiny would have been quite different. She would have remained focused on her works until the day when the conflict would have affected her directly. Seeing that the miscreants wanted to damage her precious library, she took up arms and displayed her exceptional talent in combat. She then decided to go to war against those who initiated the assault: the Shapeshifters. She won many victories against them. However, noticing the lack of impact, she eventually got bored. She then decided to become a writer and succeeded in publishing several collections of poems, without much success. She then had regular correspondence with an admirer named \"L.\" Emily’s interest was piqued after L claimed to be her sister. But was this really true? Quite a big surprise awaited Emily considering L is… a Shapeshifter!",
